
@startuml
title Sleep Health Research - UML Sequence Diagram

actor Analyst
participant Streamlit
participant Router
participant Research
participant "RAG tool" as RAG
database ChromaDB
participant Reviewer
participant "Scope Reply" as Scope

Analyst -> Streamlit: Submit question
Streamlit -> Router: Invoke LangGraph workflow

alt In scope
    Router -> Research: Invoke research node
    Research -> RAG: Retrieve sleep evidence
    RAG -> ChromaDB: Query keyword vectors
    ChromaDB --> RAG: Ranked records
    RAG --> Research: Evidence and citation IDs

    Research -> Reviewer: Draft and evidence

    alt Evidence matched
        Reviewer --> Router: Verdict + cited answer
    else Insufficient evidence
        Reviewer --> Router: Verdict + no-evidence message
    else Unsupported draft
        Reviewer --> Router: Verdict + rejection message
    end

else Outside scope
    Router -> Scope: Invoke scope_reply node
    Scope --> Router: Outside-scope verdict and message
end

Router --> Streamlit: Return final workflow state
Streamlit --> Analyst: Display answer and verdict

@enduml

